SUMINIWA mock website assets

The original SVG courtyard and project-study artwork, HTML, CSS and JavaScript
were authored for this repository's fictional workflow demonstration.
No third-party photographic assets or web fonts are included.
The illustrations depict fictional proposals, not built projects or a real client.
Reuse and adaptation within this repository's web-production workflow are permitted.
Before client delivery, obtain the repository owner's agreement on redistribution
terms and review the client's actual content and asset permissions.
Operating-system fonts are not redistributed with this package.
